================================================================================
Third-party attribution (idea-level inspiration)
================================================================================

This kit was inspired by several open-source projects. Each entry below records
the upstream project, its license, and a one-line description of what the kit
implementation took from that direction.

No code from these projects is bundled or copied. Every kit artifact mentioned
is an independent re-implementation in our markdown-first, zero-runtime-dep
conventions. The `README.md → Acknowledgements` section provides additional
context; this file exists to satisfy Apache-2.0 §4(d) and is required to be
preserved in redistributions.

